SUMMARY:Weekend Warrior Tennis (Saturdays)
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nWe 
 are typically beginner to intermediate levels playing in a friendly\, soci
 able\, and supportive environment while not being shy to a little friendly
  competition! We may rally freely in the beginning to warm up and then mov
 e on to some quick-rotation matches between 5-7 points. No formal teams he
 re so everyone should be ready to both play with and against everyone else
  who shows up.\n\nIf you’re going to show up later than 8 AM then please
  tell us in the comments. Otherwise by signing up you agree to show up at 
 8 AM by default! Also\, if you’re running late for any reason then pleas
 e tell us in the comments – just make sure you’re not driving at the t
 ime and please always drive safely!\n\nCourts are subject to availability 
 and weather. If you make serious plans to attend then please be prepared t
 o cancel or adjust our location as needed. Furthermore\, by attending you 
 agree to be fully responsible for your own health and safety. Each person 
 is responsible for their own decision to take a break\, even if it has to 
 be in the middle of a match! So health first\, fun second\, friendly compe
 tition third!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314560425/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260430T145739Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260430T145739Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
