DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T150000
SUMMARY:Noontime Cornhole - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nCom
 e hang with us for two to three hours of casual cornhole at a local park.\
 n\nThe gathering is scheduled for Lodi Memorial Park\, behind the library\
 , 1 Memorial Dr.\, because the area has four permanent concrete boards.\n\
 nThere is not a ton of parking\, but there is a huge lot across the street
  as part of the shopping plaza.\n\nComment below if you have your own boar
 ds and beanbags\, or if you want to bring another yard game. A volleyball 
 court and basketball court\, as well as turf field\, are also on site. If 
 anyone knows of any other permanent cornhole setups in North Jersey\, feel
  free to also make that suggestion. We may relocate as a result.\n\n\\*\\*
 \\ *After playing\, we'll likely be heading somewhere for a drink and snac
 k. Feel free to suggest a spot for a post-cornhole hangout. \\*\\*\\*\n\nT
 here's no fee to play and nothing else you need to do besides show up. Com
 e anytime!! All are welcome!!! We're not in a league and are not here to a
 nalyze your form. We're here for people who haven't played in months\, may
 be years\, and just want to occasionally play and hang out.\n\nThe event c
 omes to you courtesy of prior suggestions for future events and our group'
 s WhatsApp chat.\n\nHope you'll join us for our first cornhole event. Ques
 tions or comments? You can message Andy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 20
 1-234-9609.\nCheck out bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, tennis\, skating or
  one of our other activities at: [www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-socc
 er-volleyball](https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyba
 ll)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/313591683/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260301T202724Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260301T202724Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
