DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260509T170000
SUMMARY:V for Volleyball at Overpeck Park
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nI'm
  Mike and my son is Michael. Join us as we play for fun initially\, then w
 e'll keep score. When we make teams\, we'll get a bit competitive where yo
 u must serve to score! Games will be to 25 or 15 or 10 if we have more peo
 ple playing.\nOutdoor hard court. No kicking\, no using your head.\nWe may
  be going to Tropical Juice Bar after at 60 River St. in Hackensack for fo
 od/drinks.\nThere's no fee to play\, maybe bring a ball. We'll have 2 Mika
 sa balls & 1 Wilson ball.\nIt's not on 41 Willow Tree Road\, Leonia\, NJ.\
 nThe court is open to the public and if it happens to be taken\, we may pl
 ay with those already playing it or we will move to the grass since we hav
 e our own Volleyball NET!\nIf it's looking like it'll rain\, I'll make a c
 all on whether to cancel.\nIf you have fun and would like to play with us 
 at other locations\, join us!\n[V for Volleyball New Jersey | Facebook](ht
 tps://www.facebook.com/groups/1587314685975434)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314359824/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260419T064408Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260419T064408Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
