SUMMARY:Jewish Singles Mingle   
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nJew
 ish Singles Mingle -\nOn line event.\nTuesday night talk for Jewish single
 s ages 40 to 70. Looking for a date\, relationship\, friendship? If your J
 ewish\, like Jewish culture\, the foods\, or would be interested in dating
  someone Jewish\, you are welcome to attend. We will each do a brief intro
 duction. The topic is will be - Where do you go\, and or what do you do to
  meet someone new?\nSingles only please from ages 40 to 70.
