DTSTAMP:20260509T034943Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260514T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260514T210000
SUMMARY:Christian Girl Talk -Online Zoom Event
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More (BVT)\nThi
 s event is for females only\, All ages are welcomed. It will be an online 
 event for Christian Females.\n\nI asked Chat GPT some good Christian Girl 
 Talk questions and we will be taking turns answering them. We will go thro
 ugh as many questions as we can in the limited time.\n\nChat GPT says:\n\n
 ### 🌿 Faith & Relationship with God\n\n* When did you feel closest to G
 od recently?\n* What’s something God has been teaching you this season?\
 n* Is there a Bible verse that’s been on your heart lately?\n* How do yo
 u handle doubt or spiritual dryness?\n\n### 💛 Identity & Purpose\n\n* D
 o you feel called to something specific right now?\n* How do you deal with
  comparison or insecurity?\n\n### 🤍 Friendships & Community\n\n* What d
 oes a Godly friendship look like to you?\n* How can we better support each
  other in our faith?\n* Have you ever had to set boundaries in a friendshi
 p? What was that like?\n* How do you handle conflict in a Christ-like way?
 \n\n### 💍 Dating\, Love & Relationships\n\n* What qualities do you valu
 e most in a Godly relationship?\n* How do you guard your heart while datin
 g?\n* What does “waiting on God” look like in relationships?\n* How do
  you balance faith and emotions in romantic situations?\n\n### 🌸 Life S
 truggles & Growth\n\n* How do you respond when prayers feel unanswered?\n*
  What helps you stay grounded during hard times?\n* How has a difficult se
 ason strengthened your faith?\n\n### 📖 Fun but Meaningful\n\n* Which wo
 man in the Bible do you relate to most and why?\n* If you could ask God on
 e question right now\, what would it be?\n* What does your “dream life
 ” look like if God is at the center?
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314583991/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260501T202401Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260501T202401Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
